WEBVTT

11:30.341 --> 11:31.968
That's for you, love.

11:41.811 --> 11:45.147
The same dollmaker
makes all of Princess Myrcella's toys.

11:47.316 --> 11:48.651
Don't you like it?

11:49.485 --> 11:52.280
I haven't played with dolls since I was eight.

11:53.614 --> 11:56.867
- May I be excused?
- You've barely eaten a thing.

11:57.702 --> 12:00.079
It's all right. Go on.
